  "text": "### 4. Fraud/Unauthorized Transactions  \n**Example:** Customer claims fraudulent transaction  \n**Investigation:**\n- Obtain customer statement\n- Review transaction details\n- Check if customer authorized\n- Assess fraud likelihood\n- Fraud team investigation (if needed)  \n**Resolution:**\n- If fraud confirmed: Full reimbursement within 10 business days + apology\n- If customer liable: Explain (educational)\n- If disputed: Further investigation + FCA guidance  \n**See:** [[policy_fraud]] for fraud-specific procedures",
